        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our corporate customers, we offer various financial services and products such as online banking, cash management solutions, domestic/foreign currency transaction services and trade finance on a global basis.",
        "start_character": 67443,
        "end_character": 67655
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-283791",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-283791-b6d9dd523c3e9fab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-283791",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For public sector customers, as a leading bank with a wealth of experience and a solid track record, we provide optimal financial services group-wide that include funding support as a trustee and underwriter of public bonds, and services as a designated financial institution.",
        "start_character": 55903,
        "end_character": 56179
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-283791",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-283791-b6d9dd523c3e9fab",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-283791",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, to support smooth asset succession, we provide products and services that utilize our trust functions such as Multifunctional Safety Trust and will trusts, and inheritance arrangement services.",
