        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are working to provide solutions from a long-term perspective by capturing market trends in various business areas such as enhancement of business functionalities in light of the progress in digital transformation while maintaining our role as a stable settlement platform.",
